# 🛒 MERN Item Manager

A full-stack Item Manager application built with the MERN stack (MongoDB, Express, React, Node.js), deployed separately on Vercel (frontend) and Render (backend).

---

## 🔗 Live Demo

- **Frontend:** [your-app.vercel.app](https://your-app.vercel.app)
- **Backend API:** [your-api.onrender.com](https://your-api.onrender.com)

